    <briefdescription>
<para>A node (context) in the loaded contextual profile, suitable for mutation during IPO passes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We generally expect a fraction of counters and callsites to be populated. We continue to model counters as vectors, but callsites are modeled as a map of a map. The expectation is that, typically, there is a small number of indirect targets (usually, 1 for direct calls); but potentially a large number of callsites, and, as inlining progresses, the callsite count of a caller will grow. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
